Adafruit LT8912B Arduino driver
Copyright (c) 2026 Adafruit Industries

This project adapts LT8912B initialization and register programming from
Espressif's esp_lcd_lt8912b component in esp-bsp:
https://github.com/espressif/esp-bsp/tree/master/components/lcd/esp_lcd_lt8912b

The source files used carry these notices:
  esp_lcd_lt8912b.c:
    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2023-2026 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
  esp_lcd_lt8912b.h:
    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2024-2026 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
  SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Adafruit's changes include an Arduino Wire/BusIO interface, separated bridge
control and ESP32-P4 display support, and Arduino examples. The adapted code
is not an unmodified copy of the upstream component.

